# name: g4-rename-resign-move
# cites: tier 0 undeclared-member and the viewer's demo story (docs/LAYERED_DOCUMENT.md): over four replies a function is renamed, another re-signed and a third moved to a new file while one compile error stays open; its key and the block it names keep their identity as its title changes (R-ID-4, R-ID-5, R-ID-6, R-ISS-5, R-VWR-5)
# allowed: src/calc.cpp src/geometry.cpp
# policy: useStore=yes
# expect: staged:legacy | staged:legacy | staged:legacy | passed
--- base src/calc.cpp
#include <stdexcept>

double divide(double a, double d)
{
    if (d == 0) return 0;
    return a / d;
}

double square(double x)
{
    return x * x;
}

double area(double r)
{
    return 3 * square(r) + legacy(r);
}
--- gate
compile 'legacy' was not declared in this scope when src/calc.cpp contains legacy(
test area passes when src/calc.cpp contains square(r)
--- reply
