--- expect-store
# Hand-written (its key is a hash of the message, so it is found by its kind). One compile issue ('legacy' was not declared) stands through the rename, the re-signing and the move, and the key never changes, so the store holds
# ONE item however many verdicts name it. Its events: the first put (the starting files); then a put each time the text of the diagnostic changes, which is on replies 1
